  "instructions": [
    "1. In a large bowl, combine chicken, coriander, cumin, paprika, and salt. Mix well.",
    "2. Thread chicken onto skewers.",
    "3. Grill skewers over medium heat, brushing with peanut oil, until cooked through.",
    "4. Meanwhile, combine coconut milk, bottarga, and kecap manis in a blender.",
    "5. Blend until smooth and creamy.",
    "6. Serve grilled satay with bottarga sauce drizzled on top.",
    "7. Garnish with lime wedges and serve immediately."
